    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Welcome to &quot;VRLegs&quot;, where the thrill of parkour meets the immersive world of virtual reality. Step into a realm where your movements are fluid, intuitive, and empowering. Our state-of-the-art locomotion system redefines how you move, jump, and traverse in the VR space, offering an unparalleled sensation of freedom.<br><br>Challenge friends or team up in heart-pounding multiplayer tag matches. Navigate complex terrains, leap across buildings, and experience the exhilaration of real-time chases. As you master your environment, you'll discover new strategies, shortcuts, and moves to stay one step ahead or elude capture.<br><br>Whether you're a parkour enthusiast or new to the world of VR, &quot;VRLegs&quot; promises an adrenaline-pumping experience like no other. Join the revolution, find your rhythm, and let the chase begin!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Visit the open world with complete freedom of your actions!</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863820/extras/ebdcbc656ec2bfb2f2c491e3c3df8bc9.poster.avif?t=1727440096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863820/extras/ebdcbc656ec2bfb2f2c491e3c3df8bc9.webm?t=1727440096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863820/extras/ebdcbc656ec2bfb2f2c491e3c3df8bc9.mp4?t=1727440096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Meet with your friends in multiplayer mode!</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863820/extras/18cd092220d5a4bf9bbf89f56ac3ac64.poster.avif?t=1727440096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"h